Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,KOSHIN WARD, GUICHENG ISLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:01:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,THROB THROB THROB
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,THROB THROB THROB
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th... This body...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is not... bad...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel... "bonds"...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}more strongly... than before...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He threw away the title of\N"greatest genius in the Academy's history"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and ended up in a body like that...\Nand he's satisfied with it?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way\Nhe could escape from Sensei.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So why?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We didn't run.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touko and I had no special talents,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so to survive at the Academy, we willingly\Nunderwent extreme body modifications.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And thanks to that, we're now in Class A.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what's the point?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This power is too much for us,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and one day,\Nit's gonna consume our bodies and kill us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did we... no...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}make the right choice\Nas her older brother?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,AWAITING STATUS REPORT.\NPLEASE RESPOND.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Material.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Its very nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,combined with the creator's intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,gives rise to a new "vessel."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pottery is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets you experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the primal pleasure of creating something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,DEADUCATOR
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In some ways\Nit is like the job of a deaducator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagi was special...\Nthe closest to perfection
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,of all the "vessels" I have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get him back somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Get him back"?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never imagined he'd be willing\Nto forgive him for escaping...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nagi was exceptional, for sure,\Nbut why would he go that far?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,U... Um, Sensei. About Nagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A wheel... chair...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on our battle the other day,\NI'd say the bullet lodged in his brain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,has left him\Nin a strange state of paralysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and he only awakens\Nwhen killing intent is directed at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Naozumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Y... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think I hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Ah... um... er...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Um...\N- Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eh, ah...\N- Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,U... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- One...\N- Shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,O... Or something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cos you're always barefoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wear socks sometimes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in ten years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Y... Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,things that are "imperfect."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand how I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Carefully tending a "vessel"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and watching it\Ncome so close to "perfection,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,only to see it damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The purpose of this Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,is to create "perfect vessels."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.23,0:08:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What constantly holds great endeavors back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is imperfect trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take, for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka Tahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.41,0:08:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagi would never have ended up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,as he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Naozumi and Touko Kurosaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You two... are to continue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,your pursuit of the Tahira siblings\Non Guicheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mess up again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and it will be time for you to "graduate."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've also assigned\Na new Class A recruit to the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They just left the Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,so they should arrive\Nin around five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As their seniors, show them the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Terminating AR meeting mode.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? "The newbie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,what did he mean "five minutes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over 1,000 kilometers\Nfrom the Academy to Guicheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ICBMs are hella fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that?\N- Wow, that's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! I'm Uzu, the new Class A recruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya, Kurosaka senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Academy Regulation 25, Clause 3:\N"Class A Personnel Privileges."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Students in lower-ranked classes\Nmust obey those in higher-ranked classes."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.61,0:12:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Students in the highest-ranked Class A\Nmay petition the Student Council."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Should their request\Nbe deemed justified,"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"they may command up to 50 students"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"from Class C or lower at will\Noutside the Academy."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you were briefed\Non your way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll go over\Nthe details of this mission again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Our targets are Nagi and Shizuka Tahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They're former students\Nwho escaped the Academy three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They were in hiding until recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,when we spotted them\Nhere on Guicheng Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to track them down\Nand get a fix on their location.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be split into two groups\Nfor the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.53,0:13:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Team One will monitor\Nall land, air, and sea routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll keep them from escaping the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Two will track them down\Non the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the actual fighting\Nto us in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be absolutely clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the wheelchair fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, before you start your assignments...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sing the school anthem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where trees and grasses lie withered{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beasts and creatures gone\NUpon this desolate wasteland{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There towers our alma mater\NBathed in rusty hues{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Train hard. Compete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The blood our friends have shed{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shall be our sustenance{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Touko. The newbie, Uzu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He was at breakfast, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? "Post-meal exercise"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he think this is all a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why the hell did Sensei send\Na guy like that to help us?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno, but it looks like\Nsome crazy guy's whooping a gang's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Crazy guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Naozumi... senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And Touko senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about done,\Nso hang on a sec, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't budge!\NWhat the hell kind of strength is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that guy off the boss, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Haaagh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch, just diiiiie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come at me\Nall fired up like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get all fired up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.81,0:16:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy... those wounds\Nare nothing to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... um... hang on a sec.\NLet me get things straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all... who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're wanted criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked 'em up on a bounty site.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... so, what do they have to do\Nwith our mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're totally related to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cos like, Nagi as he is now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,is only able to hang on to life\Nby getting hit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,with strong killing intent, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, can you pull these blades out\Nfor me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So wouldn't that mean\Nall the strong guys on Guicheng
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,could basically be "medicine" for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So crushing as many of them as possible\Nto thin their numbers would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Touko senpai, I want you to take that out,\Nnot push it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, just by taking a walk\Nround here this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to bag me\Nplenty of potential "medicine."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to "the most dangerous place\Nin the universe."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kurosaka, tough break, huh.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard they've got you\Non that Tahira thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The "stars of the ordinary"\Nwho worked their way into Class A,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where only monsters\Nborn with mad talent belong.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guess this is finally the end\Nfor the Kurosaka siblings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before you die,\Nsend me some pics of Touko, will ya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll preserve 'em on my HDD\Nfor her fans' sake.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it, pervy electro-brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Terasawa,\Nyou're in Student Affairs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As an old Class B classmate,\NI've got a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, what is it?\NDon't go getting me into trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some info on a Class A newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's "Uzu."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whoa, no can do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Class B student like me{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}accessing Class A info without permission\Nmight even be a school rule violation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Disciplinary Committee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Terasawa from Class B has a folder\Non his computer named "test study"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The girls' locker room folder...\NHow did...?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to be collecting materials\Non anti-school ideas in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, hey! I never said I wouldn't do it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it's for my good friend,\Nthis is nothing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And... a hit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this for real?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hang on a sec.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've just shared my screen with you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"A+" is the highest access restriction\Nthere is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even Class A, the school's top class,\Nisn't allowed to access this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means access is granted...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Only to... Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrap it nice and gentle, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His wounds... they were really bad...\Nand yet they'd almost fully healed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That invulnerability of his...\Nit's almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,KILL
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a little greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll make Sensei admit\NI'm better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.69,0:21:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SALINE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.10,0:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ILLUSTRATION BY: KASUMI YASUDA
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:24:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SUBTITLES BY: MARDI MIYAKE
